        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579598811772-d470c24d4660?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3OTM5NzczODB8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post rust" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;rust-langrust&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/rust-lang/rust&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;rust-lang/rust&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;picture&gt;
    &lt;source media=&#34;(prefers-color-scheme: dark)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rust-lang/www.rust-lang.org/master/static/images/rust-social-wide-dark.svg&#34;&gt;
    &lt;source media=&#34;(prefers-color-scheme: light)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rust-lang/www.rust-lang.org/master/static/images/rust-social-wide-light.svg&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img alt=&#34;The Rust Programming Language: A language empowering everyone to build reliable and efficient software&#34;
         src=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rust-lang/www.rust-lang.org/master/static/images/rust-social-wide-light.svg&#34;
         width=&#34;50%&#34;&gt;
  &lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.rust-lang.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Website&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.rust-lang.org/learn/get-started&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Getting started&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.rust-lang.org/learn&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Learn&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.rust-lang.org/learn#learn-use&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Documentation&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;CONTRIBUTING.md&#34; &gt;Contributing&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the main source code repository for &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.rust-lang.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Rust&lt;/a&gt;. It contains the compiler,
standard library, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;why-rust&#34;&gt;Why Rust?
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Fast and memory-efficient, suitable for critical services, embedded devices, and easily integrated with other languages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Our rich type system and ownership model ensure memory and thread safety, reducing bugs at compile-time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Productivity:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive documentation, a compiler committed to providing great diagnostics, and advanced tooling including package manager and build tool (&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/rust-lang/cargo&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Cargo&lt;/a&gt;), auto-formatter (&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/rust-lang/rustfmt&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;rustfmt&lt;/a&gt;), linter (&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/rust-lang/rust-clippy&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Clippy&lt;/a&gt;) and editor support (&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/rust-lang/rust-analyzer&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;rust-analyzer&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;quick-start&#34;&gt;Quick Start
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/ch01-01-installation.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&amp;ldquo;Installation&amp;rdquo;&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/index.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;The Book&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;installing-from-source&#34;&gt;Installing from Source
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you really want to install from source (though this is not recommended), see
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;INSTALL.md&#34; &gt;INSTALL.md&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;getting-help&#34;&gt;Getting Help
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.rust-lang.org/community&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://www.rust-lang.org/community&lt;/a&gt; for a list of chat platforms and forums.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;contributing&#34;&gt;Contributing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;CONTRIBUTING.md&#34; &gt;CONTRIBUTING.md&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For a detailed explanation of the compiler&amp;rsquo;s architecture and how to begin contributing, see the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://rustc-dev-guide.rust-lang.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;rustc-dev-guide&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;license&#34;&gt;License
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rust is primarily distributed under the terms of both the MIT license and the
Apache License (Version 2.0), with portions covered by various BSD-like
licenses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;LICENSE-APACHE&#34; &gt;LICENSE-APACHE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;LICENSE-MIT&#34; &gt;LICENSE-MIT&lt;/a&gt;, and
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;COPYRIGHT&#34; &gt;COPYRIGHT&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;trademark&#34;&gt;Trademark
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://rustfoundation.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;The Rust Foundation&lt;/a&gt; owns and protects the Rust and Cargo
trademarks and logos (the &amp;ldquo;Rust Trademarks&amp;rdquo;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to use these names or brands, please read the
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://rustfoundation.org/policy/rust-trademark-policy/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Rust language trademark policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Third-party logos may be subject to third-party copyrights and trademarks. See
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.rust-lang.org/policies/licenses&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Licenses&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
